Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-07-2001||03:24 PM||||So I'm at work & bored.. I called a tire shop & ordered a set of wheels & tires for winter. I wanted 16x7" wheels (40mm offset) & 225/50/16 rubber. They say the tires wont fit the Fiero without problems.. (I'm useing Eibach lowering springs) Now I know Oreif has a set of 15x7" with 225/50/15's on his car & has no problems. Won't the 16"ers work the same? It only makes the wheel a half an inch taller... PLEASE give your input.. I need to call the guy back today..<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rightsig.gif">  <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||11
